h lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Watch the rut at the end of the lane. The rain dug it deeper, and a cart tipped over in it the day before yesterday.","zh":"巷口那道车辙你留神点。下过一场雨又冲深了，前天还有辆车在那儿翻了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Mind your purse in the crowd by the gate.","zh":"城门边人多，看好你的钱袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk0"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk0"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk0"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk1","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Octavia Sunwright","zh":"屋大薇·日匠"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":2,"y":3},"facing":"down","props":{"age":28,"household":"holy.dawnholm.h1","purse":2,"favourite":"item/food/fish/catfish"},"contents":["holy.dawnholm.folk1.coin0","holy.dawnholm.folk1.coin1"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.ponytail","face":"face.bright","outfit":"outfit.dress","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"leaf","outfit.1":"ochre","outfit.2":"ivory","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":6,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":4,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":2,"y":3,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":7,"y":3,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":2,"y":3,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"holy.dawnholm","x":26,"y":15,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"You're not from here, are you? There have been more people on the road than usual lately. They say the Church is calling for pilgrims.","zh":"你是外地来的吧？这阵子路上的人比往年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"It gets dark earlier every day. Our lamp oil used to last till spring; this year I doubt it will see midwinter.","zh":"天黑得一天比一天早了。我家的灯油往年能点到开春，今年怕是撑不到冬至。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk1"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk1"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk2","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Valeria Sunwright","zh":"瓦莱丽娅·日匠"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":2,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":6,"household":"holy.dawnholm.h1","purse":1,"favourite":"item/misc/doll"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["holy.dawnholm.folk2.coin0"],"look":{"body":"girl","parts":{"hair":"hair.childbob","face":"face.child","outfit":"outfit.smock","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"copper","eyes":"hazel","outfit.1":"moss","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"holy.dawnholm","x":18,"y":24,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.dawnholm","x":18,"y":24,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-2","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Can you hop to the well and back on one foot? I can. I did twenty hops without switching.","zh":"你能单脚跳到井边再跳回来吗？我能，我跳了二十下都没换脚。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"My mum says I can't go out after dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Mind your purse in the crowd by the gate.","zh":"城门边人多，看好你的钱袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk2"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3","type":"actor/person/fisher","name":{"en":"Seraphina Lambwell","zh":"塞拉菲娜·羔井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.dawnholm","x":19,"y":14},"facing":"down","props":{"age":55,"household":"holy.dawnholm.h2","purse":4,"favourite":"item/material/gold_ingot","stock":"item/food/fish/raw*3|item/misc/bait*3"},"tags":["merchant"],"contents":["holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.0","holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.1","holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.2","holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.0","holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.1","holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.2","holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin0","holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin1","holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin2","holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin3"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.bun","face":"face.keen","age":"age.lined","outfit":"outfit.oilcloth","legs":"legs.stockings","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"steelgrey","eyes":"sky","outfit.1":"mustard","legs.1":"ivory","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"fisher","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":6,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-3","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"holy.dawnholm","x":19,"y":14,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-3","x":7,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.dawnholm","x":19,"y":14,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"holy.dawnholm.home-3","x":7,"y":4,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fish have all gone down deep lately. Two all morning, that's all. It wasn't like this in my father's day.","zh":"这阵子鱼都沉到深水里去了，一上午就钓上来两条。我爹那时候可不是这样。"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Fish come up in the rain, so I'll stay out a while longer. If you don't mind getting wet, you can watch.","zh":"下雨天鱼爱往上浮，我得多待一会儿。你不怕淋的话，就在边上看着吧。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.s1.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk3.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.dawnholm.folk3"}},{"id":"holy.dawnholm.folk4","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Aurelian Lambwell","zh":"奥勒良·羔井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.dawnholm","x":32,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":50,"household":"holy.dawnholm.h2","purse":3,"favourite":"item/material/gold_ingot"},"contents":["holy.dawnholm.folk4.coin0","holy.dawnholm.folk4.coin1","holy.dawnholm.folk4.